WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.701 --> 00:00:02.901
-Guys, it is time for
"Tonight Show" hashtags.

00:00:02.901 --> 00:00:04.300
Here we go.

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:08.133
-♪ Hashtags ♪

00:00:08.133 --> 00:00:10.634
♪ Hashtags ♪

00:00:10.634 --> 00:00:13.767
♪♪

00:00:13.767 --> 00:00:16.367
-We do this thing every week
where I send out a hashtag

00:00:16.367 --> 00:00:18.634
and we ask you guys
to respond to that topic.

00:00:18.634 --> 00:00:22.367
This week I sent out the hashtag
#LastMinuteCostumeIdeas,

00:00:22.367 --> 00:00:23.801
and I asked you guys
to post some funny

00:00:23.801 --> 00:00:26.601
Halloween costumes you could put
together at the last minute.

00:00:26.601 --> 00:00:28.067
This is to
help all of us out.

00:00:28.067 --> 00:00:29.534
If you haven't
picked out a costume,

00:00:29.534 --> 00:00:31.767
I got one for you right here.

00:00:31.767 --> 00:00:33.901
Within minutes, it was
a trending topic in the U.S.,

00:00:33.901 --> 00:00:36.667
so thank you for
playing along with us.

00:00:36.667 --> 00:00:38.868
And now I thought I'd share
some of my favorite

00:00:38.868 --> 00:00:41.033
last minute costume ideas
from you guys.

00:00:41.033 --> 00:00:42.200
Here we go.

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:45.200
This first one is from
Nazeemo620.

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:47.367
They say,
"Wear a Lakers jersey

00:00:47.367 --> 00:00:54.267
plus carry a burger equals
Shake Shaq."

00:00:54.267 --> 00:00:56.634
This one's from
RyanBartholomee.

00:00:56.634 --> 00:00:57.868
He says,

00:00:57.868 --> 00:00:59.534
"If you have boxing
gloves and Hawaiian shirt,

00:00:59.534 --> 00:01:01.968
you can become Hawaiian Punch."

00:01:01.968 --> 00:01:04.634
Not bad.

00:01:04.634 --> 00:01:05.834
So this one's easy.

00:01:05.834 --> 00:01:09.501
This one's from
WellItzDaBigSho.

00:01:09.501 --> 00:01:12.334
They say, "Carry a soccer ball
and dress like a slob.

00:01:12.334 --> 00:01:14.100
Go as Lionel Messy."

00:01:16.801 --> 00:01:18.167
-That's funny.
-Yeah. Come on.

00:01:18.167 --> 00:01:20.667
This one is from
ImWalkinOvaHear.

00:01:20.667 --> 00:01:26.167
He says, "Write 3.14159265358

00:01:26.167 --> 00:01:30.234
on an orange shirt
equals pumpkin pi."

00:01:30.234 --> 00:01:31.968
Fantastic.
-Come on. Come on.

00:01:31.968 --> 00:01:33.100
It's a thinker.

00:01:33.100 --> 00:01:34.567
-These are all doable.
-Come on.

00:01:34.567 --> 00:01:37.334
-Yeah, I might need a little.
Yeah, a little --

00:01:37.334 --> 00:01:39.067
What's it called?
A drum roll? No.

00:01:39.067 --> 00:01:41.000
A drum riff?
-Rim shot.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:42.634
Yeah, I might need a little
rim shot after all these.

00:01:42.634 --> 00:01:43.968
Pretty good.
Alright, here we go.

00:01:43.968 --> 00:01:45.701
This one's from AaronMCooley.

00:01:45.701 --> 00:01:49.400
He says, "Put your Samsung phone
inside a fanny pack and bam,

00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:51.467
you're a
Guardian of the Galaxy."

00:01:51.467 --> 00:01:53.534
[ Rim shot ]

00:01:53.534 --> 00:01:55.934
This one is from WhoU-Kiddin.

00:01:55.934 --> 00:01:59.067
They say, "Lab coat
plus hot dog in beer mug

00:01:59.067 --> 00:02:01.801
equals Dr. Frank-in-stein."

00:02:01.801 --> 00:02:04.033
[ Rim shot ]

00:02:04.033 --> 00:02:06.400
This one is from StremelUSN.

00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:09.767
He says, "I printed a sign
that said 'I love ceilings'

00:02:09.767 --> 00:02:10.934
and taped it to my shirt.

00:02:10.934 --> 00:02:12.000
At the Halloween party,

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:14.200
I told everyone
I'm a ceiling fan."

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:17.934
[ Rim shot ]

00:02:17.934 --> 00:02:20.200
This one's from SpiritualHatGuy.

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:21.400
-Oh, I love him.

00:02:21.400 --> 00:02:24.200
-He says, "Wear
a Memphis Grizzlies jersey

00:02:24.200 --> 00:02:25.701
and cover your nose
in baby powder

00:02:25.701 --> 00:02:29.167
equals Cocaine Bear."

00:02:29.167 --> 00:02:30.734
[ Rim shot ]

00:02:30.734 --> 00:02:32.033
-Wow.

00:02:32.033 --> 00:02:37.167
-This last one here
is from CH10EO.

00:02:37.167 --> 00:02:39.367
She says, "Get a white shirt
and write,

00:02:39.367 --> 00:02:41.968
"Error 404: Costume not found.'"

00:02:41.968 --> 00:02:44.067
There you have it.
That's a good one.

00:02:44.067 --> 00:02:45.901
Those are
"Tonight Show" hashtags.

00:02:45.901 --> 00:02:47.033
To check out
more of our favorites,

00:02:47.033 --> 00:02:49.634
go to
TonightShow.com/hashtags.

